---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About — Jingyuan Ren" description="About Jingyuan Ren: data science, information engineering, and communication.">
  <article class="page-shell pb-24 pt-36 sm:pb-32 sm:pt-44">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_23rem]">
      <div>
        <h1 class="max-w-5xl font-mono text-[clamp(2.5rem,6vw,5.4rem)] font-semibold leading-[0.96] tracking-[-0.07em]">Technical depth, with an eye for how systems are <span class="text-accent">understood.</span></h1>
        <div class="mt-12 max-w-3xl space-y-6 font-mono text-sm leading-8 text-muted">
          <p>I’m Jingyuan Ren, a Data Science and Information Engineering master’s student at Linköping University. My work spans applied machine learning, GenAI evaluation, sensor fusion, signal processing, and data workflows.</p>
          <p>I’m especially interested in the parts of ML that sit around the model: the quality of evidence, the evaluation design, measurement uncertainty, reproducibility, and whether a result can be explained clearly enough to trust.</p>
          <p>Before moving deeper into data science, I studied communication and documentary production. I treat that background as a supporting technical skill: it helps me organize ambiguous material, identify the important structure, and communicate decisions without losing nuance.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-10 flex gap-3"><Button href="/projects">View projects</Button><Button href="mailto:realrenjingyuan@gmail.com" variant="secondary">Contact</Button></div>
      </div>
      <aside class="h-fit rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface/60 p-7">
        <p class="eyebrow">Current focus</p>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">
          <li>Reliable retrieval and GenAI evaluation</li>
          <li>Data pipelines and reproducible experimentation</li>
          <li>Sensor data, uncertainty, and estimation</li>
          <li>Clear technical communication</li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
